        "raw": "<p>In case anyone is interested, I thought I'd share: I listen to a podcast called Lore (primarily for game ideas / concepts), and while going through the back catalog <a href=\"https://www.lorepodcast.com/episodes/34\">I found an episode</a>&nbsp;about the real-world version of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elizabeth_B%C3%A1thory\">everyone's favorite vampire</a>! :-D I thought it was an interesting and entertaining rendition of her story. :-)&nbsp;</p>",
